{
  "header": ["The page's plan for N64Recomp-browser's tools/play_page.mjs: the launcher, Load ROM on a new profile, Start Game,",
             "the intro, Start to the file select and A on Game 1, which on a new profile starts a new game. Its opening is skipped",
             "to Spiral Mountain as Start skips it once a save exists, and then Mumbo's Mountain, both by tools/warp.js; in each",
             "Banjo walks to and fro, a little further out than back (the house's door is behind him in Spiral Mountain), jumps,",
             "attacks and turns the camera, about 25 s in Spiral Mountain and 50 s in Mumbo's Mountain.",
             "Its waits and holds there are on the game's own clock, the seconds it adds each frame's length to (the struct at",
             "0x8037E8E0's +8, read in 60ths), so every browser walks Banjo as far whatever frames it gives the game; the last step",
             "reads where Banjo is (player_position)."],
